WEBVTT

00:00:11.249 --> 00:00:11.989
[GROANING]

00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:28.963
Dennis!
There he is, right there.
–丹尼斯！他在那
–丹尼斯！宝贝！

00:00:29.137 --> 00:00:30.442
Dennis! Baby!
–丹尼斯！他在那
–丹尼斯！宝贝！

00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:32.096
DRACULA: My big boy!
–我的大孩子！
–丹尼斯，我们四处找你

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:33.271
GRIFFIN: Dennis,
we were lookin' for ya.
–我的大孩子！
–丹尼斯，我们四处找你

00:00:33.445 --> 00:00:34.838
Sweetheart.
–宝贝
–见到你太开心了

00:00:35.012 --> 00:00:35.447
FRANKENSTEIN:
I'm so happy to see you.
–宝贝
–见到你太开心了

00:00:35.622 --> 00:00:36.623
[GASPS]

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.888
There's his mean friends.
他的爪牙来了

00:00:42.629 --> 00:00:43.978
[GROANING]

00:00:47.677 --> 00:00:49.636
Oh... This'll be fun.
这个好玩

00:01:01.735 --> 00:01:02.518
[GROWLING]

00:01:02.692 --> 00:01:03.693
Whoo!

00:01:05.129 --> 00:01:05.826
[SQUEAKING] [SCREAMS]

00:01:13.485 --> 00:01:14.225
[ALL GROWLING]

00:01:21.537 --> 00:01:22.277
[WHISTLES]

00:01:23.147 --> 00:01:24.018
Huh?

00:01:24.192 --> 00:01:24.932
[ALL GROWLING]

00:01:31.199 --> 00:01:31.895
[SCREAMING]

00:01:39.294 --> 00:01:40.338
[GRUNTS]

00:01:40.512 --> 00:01:41.209
[SCREAMING]

00:01:50.697 --> 00:01:51.959
I didn't do that.
我没有都吞掉

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:52.873
[KIDS SCREAMING]

00:01:55.658 --> 00:01:56.659
[GASPS]

00:01:58.879 --> 00:01:59.836
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.146
You rock, Dennis.
–漂亮，丹尼斯
–他是说丹尼斯维奇

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.277
He means Denisovich.
–漂亮，丹尼斯
–他是说丹尼斯维奇

00:02:06.451 --> 00:02:07.714
Kakie rules!
卡蒂是最棒的！

00:02:09.541 --> 00:02:10.281
[LOUD THUD]

00:02:18.507 --> 00:02:19.900
Dennis, I'm coming. Whoa...
丹尼斯，我来了

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.166
[GROANS]
我就知道付出就有回报

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.211
I knew all that
practice would pay off.
我就知道付出就有回报

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.440
[SCREAMING]

00:02:46.274 --> 00:02:47.275
[ALL CHEERING]

00:02:51.409 --> 00:02:53.673
That's right,
you better fly away.
很好，算你们飞得快

00:02:55.326 --> 00:02:58.721
Papa Drac, I'm
a vampire and a superhero.
德古拉姥爷
我是只吸血鬼，也是超级英雄

00:02:58.895 --> 00:03:00.680
Am I cool now?
我现在棒不棒？

00:03:00.854 --> 00:03:04.292
"Now"?
Dennis, you were always cool.
“现在？”丹尼斯，你一直都是这么棒的

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:09.036
Human, vampire, unicorn,
you're perfect no matter what.
人类，吸血鬼，独角兽
不管是什么你都是最棒的

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.474
But since I'm a vampire,
can we stay here?
既然我是吸血鬼，我们能留下了吗？

00:03:13.301 --> 00:03:14.432
Yes.
可以

00:03:14.606 --> 00:03:15.651
All right! Yeah!
–太好了！耶！
–很好！

00:03:15.825 --> 00:03:16.913
GRIFFIN: All right!
–太好了！耶！
–很好！

00:03:19.307 --> 00:03:23.224
But you have to know,
we're going to visit
you here every holiday.
可你得记得，一有假，我们就会来看你

00:03:23.398 --> 00:03:25.269
That's fine.That's fine.
–很好
–很好

00:03:25.443 --> 00:03:26.183
[BOTH MOANING]

00:03:29.621 --> 00:03:30.318
[CHUCKLES]

00:03:34.844 --> 00:03:35.802
Aah!

00:03:41.198 --> 00:03:45.072
Don't ever come near
me or my family again.
离我和我的家人的远点

00:03:48.597 --> 00:03:49.729
No!
不！

00:03:56.387 --> 00:03:57.171
[CHUCKLES]

00:03:58.955 --> 00:04:02.785
Daddy, you just
saved a human.
爸爸，你拯救了一个人类

00:04:02.959 --> 00:04:05.179
[CHUCKLING] All
this pressure about
唯一的压力是孩子的牙什么时候长出来

00:04:05.353 --> 00:04:07.659
when the boy's
fangs were coming out.
唯一的压力是孩子的牙什么时候长出来

00:04:07.834 --> 00:04:11.011
Who cares? Mine came
out years ago! Look.
有什么大不了呢？
我的牙老早就出来了！看

00:04:11.794 --> 00:04:13.317
[DENNIS CHUCKLING]
好吧，爸爸，趁我们没吐，快装回去

00:04:13.491 --> 00:04:16.059
Okay, Dad, put 'em back
in before we all barf.
好吧，爸爸，趁我们没吐，快装回去

00:04:16.233 --> 00:04:19.671
Hey! Isn't it still
somebody's birthday?
嘿！可以回去给某人过生日了吗？

00:04:19.846 --> 00:04:20.716
[ALL CHEERING]

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:21.848
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.034
[CHUCKLING]

00:04:50.485 --> 00:04:51.225
[ALL CHEERING]

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:02.453
[BOTH EXCLAIMING]

00:05:14.639 --> 00:05:15.771
[GASPS]

00:05:15.945 --> 00:05:17.425
MAVIS: Let me hear you sing!
给我们唱两句

00:05:19.601 --> 00:05:20.907
I didn't do that.
我没有都吞掉

